Tiggrat Studio

How to request deletion

Open Letter Drop! and find your friend code on your profile page.
Email tiggratstudio@gmail.com with the subject "Delete my data" and include your friend code.
We'll delete your data within 30 days and reply to confirm.

What we delete

Your online profile: username, icon, title, level, high score, achievements and friend code
Your friends list and any pending friend requests
Your weekly league scores
Your Letter Drop! sign-in account

What is kept

Analytics and crash reports: gameplay and diagnostic data collected through Google Firebase. It isn't linked to your name, and Google deletes it automatically after its retention period (up to 14 months).
Your saved game on Google Play Games: this belongs to your Google account. You can delete it yourself under Google Play Games > Settings > Delete Play Games account & data.
Your saved game on your device: removed when you uninstall the app.
Purchase records: Google Play keeps these as required for payment and tax purposes.
